ld and new alike. On a stormy summer day, a mysterious young girl, Aisia, arrives at Jun'ichi's door. She is looking for Sakura's grandmother to study magic, ultimately hoping to bring happiness to everyone. When she discovers that grandmother Yoshino had long since passed away, she joyfully assumes (thanks to his error in judgment) that Jun'ichi is able to teach her. Even though she finally understands that the only magic he's capable of is conjuring Japanese confections, Aisia continues her search for magic on Hatsune-Jima. Amid the chaos of her search, Kazami Academy hires new medical staff.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Female Harem","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shrine Maiden","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"D.C.S.S. ~Da Capo Second Season~","english":"D.C.S.S. ~Da Capo Second Season~","native":"D.C.S.S. ～ダ・カーポ セカンドシーズン～","romaji":"D.C.S.S.: Da Capo Second Season","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"D.C.S.S. 〜ダ・カーポ セカンドシーズン〜"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"初音岛 第二季"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}